{
    "title": "Dressup: AI photo Editor & Art",
    "description": "Utilize the power of interesting and advanced AI technology along with user-friendly photo editing tools to effortlessly enhance your selfies and portraits with an AI Effect. Enjoy the process!\r\n\r\nSupported AI-generated photo styles include:\r\n\r\n<b>AI Dress Up</b>\r\nSimply upload a single profile picture and we will create a diverse range of astonishing photos for you, this app offers a fun and convenient way for you to explore fashion styles, try on different outfits virtually, and get a glimpse of how they would look in various dresses, including wedding dresses, business suit! Share them on social media and leave your fans amazed!\r\n\r\n<b>AI Yearbook Photo Trends</b>\r\nTake a trip down memory lane and envision yourself as a high school graduate from the '90s. Easily generate AI Yearbook photos, share your high school graduation pictures on social media, and introduce your followers to a different version of yourself.\r\n\r\n<b>Aging Time Machine</b>\r\nEver wondered what you would look like at a different age? With image processing apps, you now have the ability to visualize these transformations in a fun and engaging manner. Witness yourself as a child, a wise elder, or explore a whole new identity.\r\n\r\n<b>Face editing tools</b>\r\n- One-click Beauty: Retouch your skin, adjust face tone, erase wrinkles, and apply face filters.\r\n- Hair Color, Hairstyle: Experiment with different hairstyles and transform your look.\r\n\r\nSimply take or upload a selfie and prepare to meet your alter ego.\r\n\r\nWe are continuously developing more features! If you encounter any issues or have suggestions, please feel free to contact us anytime at fillogfeedback@outlook.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Utilize the power of interesting and advanced AI technology along with user-friendly photo editing tools to effortlessly enhance your selfies and portraits with an AI Effect. Enjoy the process!<br><br>Supported AI-generated photo styles include:<br><br><b>AI Dress Up</b><br>Simply upload a single profile picture and we will create a diverse range of astonishing photos for you, this app offers a fun and convenient way for you to explore fashion styles, try on different outfits virtually, and get a glimpse of how they would look in various dresses, including wedding dresses, business suit! Share them on social media and leave your fans amazed!<br><br><b>AI Yearbook Photo Trends</b><br>Take a trip down memory lane and envision yourself as a high school graduate from the &#39;90s. Easily generate AI Yearbook photos, share your high school graduation pictures on social media, and introduce your followers to a different version of yourself.<br><br><b>Aging Time Machine</b><br>Ever wondered what you would look like at a different age? With image processing apps, you now have the ability to visualize these transformations in a fun and engaging manner. Witness yourself as a child, a wise elder, or explore a whole new identity.<br><br><b>Face editing tools</b><br>- One-click Beauty: Retouch your skin, adjust face tone, erase wrinkles, and apply face filters.<br>- Hair Color, Hairstyle: Experiment with different hairstyles and transform your look.<br><br>Simply take or upload a selfie and prepare to meet your alter ego.<br><br>We are continuously developing more features! If you encounter any issues or have suggestions, please feel free to contact us anytime at fillogfeedback@outlook.com",
